# timing=host enqueue+completion, slowest of 4 groups/8 GPUs; warmups=20 iterations=30 repeats=1; every output checked
# packed schedule=three-slot pipeline; direct receive into eight source rows; 2D H2D copy or SM scatter per phase
collective,bytes,backend,median_us,min_us,max_us
